     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Dear all,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Please, I am new on INLA, and\r\npresently modeling anaemia prevalence using additive model<span style=\"color:black\">. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black\">My model comprises the\r\nlinear effects for the categorical fixed effect variables (using regular\r\nparametric linear predictors) on the response with diffuse priors, the\r\nnonlinear and unknown smooth effects associated with continuous covariates (RW1\r\nmodel) as well as <span> </span>the spatial effects (with\r\nICAR model) .</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black\">I have this error when I\r\nuse the INLA function for the model as below.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">formula &lt;- (Anaemia~ + Placeofresidence + Wealthindex + Educationalstatus + Sex+f( Age ,model= “ rw1”) + f(\r\nfamilysize ,model= “ rw1”) f( Temperature ,model= “ rw1”) <span> </span>+ f( Rainfall ,model= “ rw1”) + f( Altitude\r\n,model= “ rw1”) + f( Aridity, model= “ rw1”)+f(region, model= “besag”, graph= “Map.adj”)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">         \r\n    </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">result&lt;-inla(formula,family\r\n=&quot;binomial&quot;,data=anaemiadata, control.predictor</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">=list(compute=T,link=1),control.compute=list(dic=TRUE,waic=TRUE,cpo=TRUE),verbose=TRUE)</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&q